# SunMint — Ask-1 (tree→plot association) + Ask-2 (expected_trees / counted_trees)
#
# Target repo: TrueSightDAO/sunmint (API-only data repo — apply via grep/Contents API,
#   NOT a branch edit).
# Apply from the sunmint repo root:
#     git apply patches/2026-10-14_sunmint_plot_association_and_expected_trees.patch
#   (paths below are script paths relative to the sunmint root, NOT this file's dir;
#    strip this text header first, or use:
#       sed -n '/^diff --git/,$p' <thisfile> | git apply - )
