# What it does
#   Ask-1  build_tree_geojson.py: grade each tree against plots/index.geojson —
#          plot_assoc ∈ {inside, near(≤50 m), none}; derive plot_id when inside;
#          sheet Plot ID stays an explicit override. Adds plot_dist_m, nearest_plot_id.
#   Ask-2  build_plots_geojson.py: emit polygon_ha, expected_trees (default 3.0×3.0 m
#          grid → 1,111 trees/ha; gated OFF for mature/enrichment/research/nursery/
#          infrastructure), counted_trees (observed points inside the ring),
#          tree_spacing_m (optional sheet override).
#   SCHEMA.md + two new tests/ files.
#
# Validation (2026-10-14): full sunmint suite 122 passed; 23 new tests.
#   Real data → plot_assoc: inside=116, near=9, none=20; estimable total ≈133,920.
